6050..6126 Comment "/// Function extensionality from a homotopy, through the path space: the map"
6127..6201 Comment "/// takes a point to both functions\' results there and the homotopy\'s path"
6202..6278 Comment "/// between them. Its first end reads the first result, a returned call, and"
6279..6353 Comment "/// a returned call is the call it holds, so the end is `f`; the second is"
6354..6362 Comment "/// `g`."
